B.atv=new A.dx(0,4.2,"We all know that sinking feeling when a deadline is approaching and we haven't even started.")
B.ats=new A.dx(4.5,8.8,"Instead of working on what matters, we find ourselves scrolling through social media or reorganizing our desk.")
B.atd=new A.dx(9.1,13.5,"Procrastination isn't really about being lazy or having poor time management skills.")
B.atK=new A.dx(13.8,18.2,"It's actually an emotional regulation problem, a way our brain tries to avoid negative feelings.")
B.atZ=new A.dx(18.5,22.8,"When a task feels overwhelming, boring, or tied to our fear of failure, our brain seeks immediate comfort.")
B.atO=new A.dx(23.1,27,"Research from psychology shows that procrastinators often struggle with managing difficult emotions.")
B.atT=new A.dx(27.3,31.5,"The irony is that avoiding the task usually makes those negative feelings even stronger over time.")
B.atP=new A.dx(31.8,36.2,"One simple strategy is to break your work into tiny pieces and commit to just five minutes.")
B.ata=new A.dx(36.5,40.5,"Once you actually start, you'll often find that the resistance fades away surprisingly quickly.")
B.ato=new A.dx(40.8,44,"Understanding the emotional root of procrastination is the first step toward beating it.")
B.bsw=s([B.atv,B.ats,B.atd,B.atK,B.atZ,B.atO,B.atT,B.atP,B.ata,B.ato],t.Zo)
